#7500
"Inside a Tangle of Roots"
"You are inside a tangled mass of roots high above the ground in a very large
cave.  The tangled roots provide a convenient, natural stairwell leading
through a hole above you all the way down to the cavern floor.  The entire
stairway of roots is woven around with a criss-cross of smaller roots forming
a cage of sorts that prevents you from falling off the stairs.
"
